From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ethan <ethan@localhost>
Date: Sun, 7 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: xradio: defer OOB host-wake IRQ registration until BH thread ready

The OOB host-wake IRQ was requested at the very beginning of sdio_probe(),
before xradio_register_bh() had initialized bh_wq. Any interrupt arriving
in that window (e.g. PG15 level/edge transitions during power-on) reaches
xradio_irq_handler() and calls wake_up() on an uninitialized waitqueue,
causing a NULL pointer panic (xradio_irq_handler -> __wake_up_common).

Move the IRQ registration to after xradio_core_init(), so bh_wq is
guaranteed to be initialized before the IRQ can fire. During probe the
BH thread is driven by self-wakeup from wsm command submits plus the
HZ/30 timeout polling, so it does not depend on the OOB IRQ.

Signed-off-by: ethan <ethan@localhost>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/xradio/sdio.c | 13 ++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/xradio/sdio.c b/drivers/net/wireless/xradio/sdio.c
index cdc3ae0..568d92a 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/xradio/sdio.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/xradio/sdio.c
@@ -185,8 +185,6 @@ static int sdio_probe(struct sdio_func *func,
 }
 #endif
 
-	xradio_probe_of(func);
-
 	func->card->quirks |= MMC_QUIRK_BROKEN_BYTE_MODE_512;
 	sdio_claim_host(func);
 	sdio_enable_func(func);
@@ -194,7 +192,16 @@ static int sdio_probe(struct sdio_func *func,
 
 	sdio_enableint(func);
 
-	xradio_core_init(func);
+	/*
+	 * 推迟注册 OOB host-wake 中断：若在 BH 线程与 bh_wq 就绪前注册，
+	 * probe 期间 host-wake 的任何跳变/电平都会触发
+	 * xradio_irq_handler() -> xradio_bh_wakeup() -> wake_up(&bh_wq)，
+	 * 而 bh_wq 尚未 init_waitqueue_head，内核将因空指针 panic。
+	 * xradio_core_init() 内已 init_waitqueue_head(&bh_wq) 并启动 BH 线程；
+	 * probe 阶段 BH 由 wsm 命令自唤醒 + HZ/30 超时轮询驱动，不依赖 OOB 中断。
+	 */
+	if (!xradio_core_init(func))
+		xradio_probe_of(func);
 
 	return 0;
 }
